WEBVTT

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.580
I'm home.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.170
Welcome back!

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:48.340
Onii-chan, guess what!

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:49.510
Nozomi!

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.430
No cram school today? You're off?

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:53.430
Yes.

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.680
Say, Onii-chan...

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:56.390
Hmm?

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:58.770
Are you friends with Katakura Keiichi-san!?

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:00.850
Huh?

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:04.650
I noticed you at the karaoke
place today, and then...

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:06.190
Hold on.

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:08.110
You know Keiichi?

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:10.860
He helped me out once.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.030
So I'd like to thank him.

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:14.820
Could you arrange for us to meet?

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:15.280
Please?

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.200
Yeah...

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.370
No way. Absolutely not.

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:21.160
Wh-Why not?

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.960
Isn't he your friend?

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:24.460
He's a busy guy.

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:26.040
I could pass on your message.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.880
I want to tell him in person!

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.710
You don't have to do that.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:30.960
But I...

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.130
Please! It wouldn't take long!

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.220
I already said...

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:36.640
I'm not doing it!

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:44.480
Uh, hey, Nozomi...

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:45.310
I'm fine.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:46.900
I'm just...

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:47.860
...fine.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.650
Why is she crying?

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.360
She's always been a crybaby,

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.990
but that's all it took?

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:01.490
Don't tell me...!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:03.830
Here, Tsuyopon!

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.630
Okay, that's the game!

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:11.050
We haven't played portball since grade school!

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:13.590
It's nice spending free time in
gym class like this sometimes.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:15.380
Right, Mattsun?

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.510
Never mind that.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:20.470
You laid a hand on my little sister, didn't you?

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.140
What?

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.140
Your sister?

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:25.350
That's right.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.100
What're you trying to do?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.980
I haven't done anything!

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.360
You liar!

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.020
We're back!

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.690
What are you talking about?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.530
I have no idea...

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:36.820
I'll spare you the details!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.200
Keiichi-kun made a move on my sister!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.450
What?

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.620
I did not!

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:44.660
Then why does she want to meet you,

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:46.460
and thank you for helping her?!

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:48.040
I don't know!

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.630
Maybe you just forgot.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:53.000
Hm? Maybe.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.800
I forget things all the time.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:57.930
Honestly... Making a move
without even noticing?

00:03:57.930 --> 00:03:59.840
You're one heck of a natural womanizer.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.970
And you've got one heck of a sister complex.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.680
I do not!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.600
I don't really know the situation,

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.390
but couldn't you allow her to meet him?

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:07.890
No way!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:12.230
Why are you so uptight
when it comes to your sister?

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.320
Well, it's just...

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.530
What'll happen if someone falls in love with Nozomi?

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:18.740
She's too adorable!

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.490
Well? Wouldn't you want to prevent that?

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:25.410
Stop laughing!

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:28.120
Oh, come on! What's your deal?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.880
You never know what might happen
between a man and a woman!

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:33.090
You're getting mad with worry?

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:35.960
So your sister's name was Nozomi...

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.760
And she asked for Keiichi by name!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:42.550
Oh, you're worried she'll get caught up
in Kei-chan's deviant sexual practices.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:43.760
That's one thing.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.640
Also, which month is your birthday?

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:46.970
May.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.310
You see?! I'm January!

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.560
What about it?

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:51.440
It means...

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.020
If you and Nozomi get married,

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.110
you'll be my elder brother-in-law!

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.150
That would suck.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.190
Huh?

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.650
Married?!

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.110
That's a huge leap!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:04.580
Besides, the fact we're friends
would make it awkward.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.870
Well, I prefer older girls.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:09.960
So don't worry, I have no interest
in your silly little sister!

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.790
Did you just call my sister silly?!

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.880
Ugh, this guy's such a pain!

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.840
Well, Nozomi, when I told her I
wouldn't introduce you to her,

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:20.130
she started crying! Isn't that too adorable?!

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.720
You made her cry?

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:22.470
Er...

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:24.760
Wow, that's mean.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.140
The poor thing.

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:27.810
She wanted to meet him that badly, huh?

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:30.430
She must be really grateful.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.940
But then he goes and flatly refuses.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.560
Mattsun's a bully.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.650
Forcing your will on others isn't cool.

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:39.240
It's not like I'd object to just meeting her.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.110
Hey, don't gang up on me!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:43.740
Fine! I'll introduce you to her!

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:44.910
Mattsun caved!

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.160
I'm sure your sister will be happy.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:51.580
Yeah! I can already imagine
the look of joy on her face!

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:56.500
Thank you!

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.500
I'm really, really happy about this!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.300
Once school lets out, I'll come over
to the bridge by your school!

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:03.220
Thank you so much.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.680
She's way too happy about this.

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:09.140
Guess I have no choice...

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.430
I don't want to leave her in tears again.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:13.310
Later.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.190
We're heading off.

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:15.520
Huh?

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.860
You too, Tsuyopon?

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:18.190
Why?

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.030
You want to meet his sister?

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:21.820
Well, that's part of it, but...

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.320
I'm meeting up with Yukirin at the river.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:26.870
She wants to discuss something.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.740
You've got committee, don't you?

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.040
Why not come by after?

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.290
Sure...

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:33.370
Well, see you later.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.290
Why do I have to have committee now...?

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.340
Hashiba-kun.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:41.210
Hello.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.670
Kobayakawa-san!

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:44.800
H-Hello!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.640
It's been a while since the last committee meeting.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:47.550
Yes, it has.

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:49.310
I think...

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:51.390
...it's probably for the school-wide cleanup.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.440
Oh, right, have you heard from Yukirin yet?

00:06:57.440 --> 00:06:58.980
Hm? What about?

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:01.610
We'll all be going someplace.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:04.070
Mari-chan and I were invited, too.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.070
I look forward to going together.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:07.740
Hm?

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:09.830
What're you talking about?

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.080
Tsuyoponnu!

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.370
Sorry, did you wait long?

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:16.080
Yo!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.040
Wow!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.500
You two are here as well, huh?

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.630
They're meeting up with Mattsun's little sister.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:25.220
Mattsuntsukutsun has a sister!?

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:26.220
Yeah.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.800
Wait, what's <i>tsukutsun</i>?

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:28.680
Your nickname!

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:29.430
Kinda long...

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:30.930
Where's Natsuking?

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:31.970
Committee.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.390
Oh.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:36.690
But, since you're all here,
now might be a good time.

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:37.600
For what?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.770
Well, you see...

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:39.940
Oh!

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:41.400
Nozomi!

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:42.360
Onii-chan!

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:46.450
Oh, Onii-chan!

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:48.110
Thank you so much!

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.120
It's fine, not much else I could've done...

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.740
I was so excited, I used
my cellphone at school!

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:53.910
You're Mattsun's...

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.080
...little sister?

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:55.910
Oh.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:56.410
Ah!

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:58.210
Nice to meet you!

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:59.670
I am Matsunaga Nozomi!

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.670
Thank you for always taking
such good care of my brother!

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:03.300
Oh no, he always helps us, too.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:07.880
Wow, you'd never guess she was Mattsun's
sister, given how polite she is.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:08.720
Hm.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:10.390
Hey, Tsuyoponnu...

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:11.220
Isn't that girl...

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.430
Hm?

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:13.640
Here, Nozomi.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.640
Don't you dare say anything weird.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.060
I know, I know!

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:21.810
Um...!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.820
I wanted to thank you once more, properly!

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:26.360
I'm so glad to see you again!

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:30.320
Thank you so, so much for
what you did for me at the beach!

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:31.990
At the beach?

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.660
You don't remember?!

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.240
Kei-kun, it was that thing!

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:37.160
You gave her a piggyback ride!

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.170
Piggyback...

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:40.080
A Piggyback ride?

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.500
When we all went to the beach.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.800
The girl who hurt her foot!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.720
Is your foot all better now?

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.680
Y-Yes, it's fine!

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:53.640
I... At that time, I really...

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:54.850
...really...

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:57.350
thought you looked so princely!

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:58.140
Huh?

00:08:58.140 --> 00:08:59.640
You still do.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.360
Wh-What are you saying, Nozomi?!

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:06.190
W-Well, that's how he looks to me!

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.820
This guy's not a prince!

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:10.360
That's not true!

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.490
Adorable!

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.870
Your sister is too adorable!

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.080
I'm princely?

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.160
No, O Prince.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.040
And you...

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:20.250
You did do something!

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:22.170
What was this piggyback ride?

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:25.000
Well, she was hurt and had trouble walking!

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.000
You could've lent her a shoulder!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.510
I thought that might be hard,
with our height difference.

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:30.930
Since you're a prince,

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:33.890
maybe the princess-carry
would've worked better.

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:36.600
And why is it you two seem
to know all about it?

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.390
We happened to see them.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.600
You should've told me right then!

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.560
We didn't know she was your sister.

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:46.070
I think Kei-kun was pretty cool that time.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:47.820
Yes, very!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:52.740
She's totally into him!

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:55.780
No, no. You can't be sure of that.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.080
I can tell!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:00.370
Oh, I thought you might.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.870
What am I going to do?

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.250
Nozomi is too adorable.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.250
Keiichi is my friend.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.590
But I just can't accept this...

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:12.550
Wait. maybe I'll feel more comfortable
if she's with a guy I know well.

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:13.970
Or maybe more worried?

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:17.350
Hm... you seem kind of down.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.180
Oh, I know!

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:21.560
Here! I brought snacks!

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:23.140
Here.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.190
Thank you very much!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.150
Hey!

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:28.270
Oh, Na-chan!

00:10:28.610 --> 00:10:30.110
You're finally here.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:33.400
Hey, is it true we're all
going on a mini-vacation?

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.030
That Yukirin arranged?

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.410
Huh?!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.990
Would you all like to go
to the amusement park?

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:41.910
Plus a hot springs resort?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:44.370
I won tickets!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.590
We'll go!

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.630
SonaPocke?

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.510
You mean that SonaPocke?

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:56.470
Yeah!

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:59.100
I found out they were running campaign

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:02.520
where you could win tickets to a resort if
you bought tickets to their outdoor concert.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:04.940
I wanted to go with you,

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:07.940
so I sent in a few applications
and won a whole bunch!

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:12.400
Amazing!

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:15.110
You truly are a goddess.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.240
Yup!

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:18.910
I'm the certified object
of Tsuyoponnu's worship!

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:21.120
Huh? What? What are you certified as?

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.790
Nothing. Okay?

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:25.160
Oh, Tsuyoponnu's embarrassed.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.420
No I'm not.

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.710
You're so cute, Tsuyoponnu!

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:30.960
Quit calling me that...
